# view-bookshelf (issue 047): the cube bookshelf seen face-on, kept for a possible future "face the bookshelf" view where you pick out a book. It is the old 034 drawing of the shelf from the side: oak cubes with colourful book spines, a cube of records, a cube with a box, a drawer column with knobs, a sansevieria and a stack of books on top. NOT drawn into the room; the room uses `bookshelf` (top-down). 1x4 tiles proportions.
size: 16x64
